# Selective Frequency Damping method
## SFD module and examples using centered.h
- **The [SFD module](/sandbox/gally/SFD.h) to be included in the header of the following file codes**
- Stabilisation of a [Kármán Vortex Street](/sandbox/gally/KarmanSFD.c) behind a 2D cylinder
- Stabilisation of a flow behind a [3D sphere](/sandbox/gally/SphereSFD.c)

## SFD module and example using stream.h
- **The [streamfunction-vorticity SFD module](/sandbox/gally/SFD_stream.h) to be included in the header of the following file code**
- Stabilisation of [Kelvin-Helmholtz instabilities](/sandbox/gally/KelvinHelmholtzSFD.c)

